# A generic value created in one package, passed through a package with no
# generics of its own, and called there through plain types: the app
# instantiates it where it converts to a plain function type, so the callee
# still has its type arguments.
# name          dir     deps                       root
@test/gen       gen     -
@test/plain     plain   -
main            app     @test/gen,@test/plain      root
